The HOMO and LUMO orbitals of the model compounds are shown in Fig. S2. Both HOMO and LUMO frontier orbitals of PDTPO-IDT and PDTPO-IDTT are well-proportioned distributed along the whole conjugated plane, which would be favorable to the charge carrier transport. Unlike low bandgap polymers, such an orbital distribution reveals a weak intramolecular
